## Unreleased

- Added `slug` command and `textkit.slug.slugify`.
- Added `top` command and `textkit.topwords.top_words` (most frequent words).
- Added `rot` command and `textkit.rot.rot` (letter rotation by any integer).
- Added `dur` command with `parse_duration` and `format_duration`.
- Added `mdtable`: CSV on stdin to a markdown table.
- Added `near` (fuzzy match by edit distance) with `levenshtein` and `closest`.
- Started the command registry (`commands`).
- Added `roman` command and `textkit.roman` with `to_roman` / `from_roman`.

